  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scale up organic pineapple production for export</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a follow-up of a Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO) supported project that successfully achieved organic certification of 35 small-scale pineapple producers in Zimbabwe.The project managed to export a first assignment to the Netherlands in 2021. In this follow-up project, a larger group of 250 farmers from the same Rusitu Farmer Trust are targeted both for organic and Global GAP certification.Furthermore, farmers will be trained in sustainable production, post-harvest operations, processing and marketing. An amount of 30 tonnes is targeted for export.The project takes place in Chipinge- Chimanimani District in Eastern Zimbabwe.</narrative>
  </description>
