       <narrative xml:lang="EN">6 broad topics were developed for training farmers, packhouse staff and internal inspectors
1. Organic farming systems (including organic control of pests and diseases)
2. Harvesting and Post- harvest handling of organic pineapples
3. GlobalG.A.P. Option 2 standard (requirements and benefits of certification, Document control and record keeping, Food safety basics and worker safety and welfare and personal hygiene)
4. Pineapple production  (Increasing plant population, soil conservation techniques and group marketing of fruit)
5. Creation of Group of Operators (Requirements for creative a cooperative, developing by-laws and constitution) 
6. New EU regulations for exporters
